# Every text file checks out with LF line endings on every platform, Windows
# included. Tests pin byte-exact hashes of fixtures, rebuild the committed
# Desktop bundle and compare it byte for byte, and read source files; a CRLF
# conversion on checkout (Git for Windows' default) breaks all three.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never converted (git already detects these; explicit for clarity).
*.png binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.zip binary
